From: GCSA-aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 01:27:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: tighten cookie lookup and block first-party collect

Classify cookies by exact names so login cookies stay, block first-party
GA/GTM collect copies, and strip more click-id query params.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
